ps://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-27-2023, 10:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-27T20:09:13-08:00","id":1501515,"title":"","content":"<b>TA</b> kidnapped to HQ <i><b>Xavi Ndaba</b></i> - nonbinary ( and intersex ) kid from the streets of Cape Town, South Africa. Xavi is first 'ever' 3rd Generation natural Psion ( or, rather, Psiad ) the <b>Pheobe Trust</b> knows about from ( <b>Pheobe Trust </b>\u200bmini book )\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>Xavi IS the Pheobe itself to them!</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> By polish Jacek Dukaj story <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfect_Imperfection\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Perfect Imperfection</i></b></a>:<br /> '<i>Post-Human Beings</i> is the next level of the evolution of human beings. Supported by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence\" target=\"_blank\">artificial intelligence</a>, one of the characteristics of a phoebe is its ability to divide itself into many copies with various levels, tasks and levels of autonomy, each of which can be tasked with analyzing and dealing with parts of reality. Another characteristic is the ability to transform both their bodies and minds.\u200b'<br /> <br /> Our Pheobe is (super?) Psiad - but still only Psiad. You can advise me on powers of Xavi could have.<br /> <br /> Also, <b>Transcendent Alliance</b>\u200b hired group of assassins from Swarm to guard Xavi, beside TA typical army. ( For <i><b>Swarm</b></i> see <b>TC Assassins</b> book ) As my 'good Assassins' PCs uncovered TA HQ right now ( and that was invisible ) - I wonder if introduce Swarm guarding ones by showing and HQ all of them, right with PCs at door saying: '<i>Nah, ah, ah, don't go inside!'</i> - shonen anime style. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If you got any other ideas for <b>Transcendent Alliance</b>\u200b - please wright here for us all! \ud83d\ude08<br /> <br /> <i><b>Xavi Ndaba</b></i>\u200b<br /> <br /> <img width=\"1366\" height=\"1263\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XijGwua.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/XijGwua.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/XijGwua.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-27-2023, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}